  "description": [
    "524 pages : 29 cm",
    "[This text] is designed to help you explore the ... world of food and nutrition. You will explore beyond familiar foods and preparation methods. A multicultural, multiethnic emphasis will encourage you to try new foods. [The text] introduces you to food and nutrition. It will lead you to develop scientific and inquiry skills, preparing you to become nutritionally literate and able to make smart food choices. - Introduction",
    "Includes index",
    "Food, nutrition, and you -- Nutrients: the building blocks of health -- Your nutrition toolbox -- Weighing your choices -- A look at the kitchen -- Cooking with microwaves -- The cook's tools -- Play it safe! -- Keep it clean! -- Recipes -- blueprints for food -- What's on the menu? -- Smart shopping -- Ready, set, cook -- When you're on the go -- Fabulous fruits -- Versatile vegetables -- Salad success -- Great grains -- Bountiful breads -- Dairy delights -- Marvelous meat and poultry -- Savory seafood -- Incredible eggs and legumes -- Delicious desserts -- A career to consider"
  ],
